ADDITIONAL SECURITY DISCLAIMER
==============================
This software is provided as a reference implementation of a "private vault"
concept on Android. It is intended for educational and research purposes.

While the author(s) have made reasonable efforts to apply sound
cryptographic practices (AES-256-CTR, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256, per-file IVs,
no plaintext-on-disk for media), no software is perfectly secure. You
should:

  1. Conduct your own security review before relying on this code for
     storing truly sensitive data.
  2. Keep your device OS up to date.
  3. Understand that losing your 6-digit password means losing access to
     your encrypted vault (there is no backdoor).
  4. Not use this code as a substitute for device-level encryption (FBE)
     or hardware-backed keystore protections.

USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.
